comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-20T04:53:16.013Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-20: selected after complete all-status live orientation across 2,525 items, full metadata/history/relationship review of this canonical lineage, and GitHub/release/security/dependency verification. This item owns the public SDK preflight primitive and migration of all 50 current literal checks across 45 files; the same branch will execute its three recovery states and add a source-derived replication ratchet."
  "2026-08-20T06:14:24.553Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence 2026-08-20: centralized all 50 current initialized-tracker checks across 45 SDK modules behind the public shared preflight; missing root, empty root, and regular-file root now emit distinct typed codes and safe tokenized recovery. The executable refusal corpus expanded 18 -> 21 and passes 21/21; the source ratchet reports 50 required occurrences and zero forbidden legacy literals. Full repository proof passes 537/537 files and 7,634/7,634 tests at exact 55,749/55,749 statements, 41,582/41,582 branches, 11,567/11,567 functions, and 53,789/53,789 lines. ESLint and jscpd passed; package artifact gate passed (1,449 files); isolated packed npm consumer recovered missing/empty roots, safely refused a file root, imported SDK contracts, and passed local npx/bunx. Secret scan, production audit (0 vulnerabilities), and Trivy high/critical vuln+secret+misconfiguration scan passed."
  "2026-08-20T06:30:11.021Z","harness:codex","Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1065 at implementation head 3a83a155f. This reviewed branch carries the shared SDK preflight, 50-site migration, typed filesystem refusals, 21-probe executable recovery gate, source ratchet, generated contracts, docs, exact coverage, package acceptance, changelog, and PM closeout."
  "2026-08-20T07:32:55.589Z","harness:codex","Review-fix evidence for PR #1065: seven valid CodeRabbit findings were implemented. The recovery builder now emits explicit --pm-path <root> init ordering; the public contract and executable corpus cover missing, settings-missing, non-directory, and unreadable roots; malformed reachability and source-ratchet declarations fail closed; optional context-intent discovery preserves typed unreadable-root errors; and the PM umbrella test-array correction was replayed through append-only pm history. One suggested control-root change was declined because select_directory intentionally proves the initialized alternate root recovery. The PM-linked run first exposed the real executable corpus test crossing Vitest 30s under full-suite contention, then passed after a scoped 60s integration-test timeout. Final PM-linked results: source-replication gate passed; 537 files and 7,635 tests passed; exact coverage 100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts; focused SDK/CLI/MCP/reachability suite 37/37 passed. Repository static quality, SDK/package parity, command grammar, flag parity/lexicon, token budgets, 22/22 refusal closure, npm audit, tracked secret scan, and Trivy high/critical including dev dependencies all passed. Fresh packed consumer smoke passed installed CLI refusal exit 3, exact tokenized recovery execution, four SDK contracts including repair_permissions, npx 2026.8.20, and bunx 2026.8.20."
  "2026-08-20T08:42:30.555Z","harness:codex","Second hosted review evidence 2026-08-20: implemented five valid CodeRabbit improvements and declined one immutable-history nit with rationale. The executable refusal fixture now restores permissions through an outer finally path, initialized preflight validates root readability before accepting settings, POSIX chmod reachability is explicitly skipped on Windows, and all affected command test doubles model a real readable tracker root. The PM-linked suite passes source replication, 537/537 files with 7,637/7,637 tests at exact 55,768/55,768 statements, 41,598/41,598 branches, 11,568/11,568 functions, and 53,808/53,808 lines, plus 39/39 focused SDK/CLI/MCP/reachability tests. Earlier failed runs remain append-only evidence of the test-double and one-branch coverage gaps that the final passing run closed."
  "2026-08-20T08:49:26.651Z","harness:codex","Final local gate note 2026-08-20: the lint umbrella passed ESLint, zero-duplicate jscpd, build/contracts/generated surfaces, repository assurance, SDK/package parity, source replication, command grammar, flag parity/lexicon, 22/22 refusal closure, tracker-context quality, gate registry, SDK surface, and SDK entrypoint costs. The transport-floor benchmark was load-sensitive (first get 414ms > 362ms; isolated replay create 409ms > 398ms) and passed all six operations on the second isolated replay; the downstream graph-composition gate passed 7/7 assertions and record-integrity passed 1/1. No code change or threshold relaxation was used."
  "2026-08-20T09:19:13.150Z","harness:codex","Final hosted review evidence 2026-08-20: resolved all three third-round CodeRabbit findings. source_pattern_ratchets now distinguishes an absent optional declaration from explicit null and fails the latter closed; close-many and list-sort fixtures use unique directories under os.tmpdir with bounded cleanup, eliminating Windows path assumptions and cross-process deletion races. Focused proof passed 23/23 tests plus the live source-replication gate and ESLint. The authoritative PM-linked replay passed all three commands: 537/537 files, 7,637/7,637 tests, exact 55,770/55,770 statements, 41,598/41,598 branches, 11,568/11,568 functions, 53,810/53,810 lines, and 39/39 focused SDK/CLI/MCP/reachability tests."
  "2026-08-20T09:43:07.641Z","harness:codex","Post-merge operational closeout 2026-08-20: PR #1065 merged as 33c0594a57cbc23e27111ee5a1e1dc41f73a9278. All six exact-merge-SHA workflows completed successfully: CI, CodeQL, Security and Script Quality, Docs, CodSpeed, and OSSF Scorecard; CI includes 100% aggregate coverage, static and token-budget assurances, compatibility, Windows, npm/npx/plugin smokes, and Node/macOS/Ubuntu runtime checks. Final PR inventory had zero unresolved threads and every bot-authored comment, review, and inline reply reacted to; CodeRabbit final re-review was rate-limited and Greptile remained silent, recorded as provider limitations rather than approvals. GitHub has zero open Dependabot, code-scanning, or secret-scanning alerts; #1065 was the only open PR and every open issue retained a main-branch PM link. Same-day policy preserved exactly one v2026.8.20 release: scheduled auto-release, release workflow, GitHub release, npm 2026.8.20, isolated published npx/bunx CLI+MCP verification, and exact installed npm+Bun agent acceptance all passed. Sentry authenticated threshold receipt: 0 recent issues, 0 critical/high, release pm-cli@2026.8.20 finalized with 22 commits and 0 new groups. Telemetry receipt: 1-day 1.86% finish error rate with 0 missing error-code rows; backend freshness at 2026-08-20 11:42:05+02 with 159 events/70 finishes in 10 minutes; inline recovery drained the local queue to queue_empty=true, zero invalid rows, and no failed-flush state."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-20T06:14:25.217Z","harness:codex","Tracker initialization is a filesystem state machine, not one missing-file boolean: preserving root-missing, non-directory, settings-missing, and readable-root states in one SDK primitive prevents unsafe recovery advice and lets executable assurance measure every transition."
